models now contains the 5 runs for the 5 splits of DINOv3, with the complex augmentations, frozen backbone and trained
with the cls token (all based on their classifier in 'classifier/models')

model.py:
Defines the EN-based MIL model

train_mil.py:
(old code, uses old videos and does not allow different splits)
trains a MIL model

utils.py:
MIL specific utils

vis_attenion.py:
(a bit messy at the moment)
visualizes the attention weights for both the whole video and the 32 sampled frames. Saves results into mil_viz